	"Name": "Stardew IRL - A Realistic Seasonal Portrait Mod - BASE GAME COMPLETE",
	"Author": "Doctorheartheartrose",
	"AuthorLabel": "-M-",
	"Description": "A set of hand drawn portraits for Stardew Valley. Comment with characters you'd like added! This folder contains no code, only PNG portrait sheets to add to the game as you'd like. I got a bit carried away and added more outfits than are ever implemented, like Sandy's seasonal pyjamas. Feel free to write something that uses these. All portraits are formatted to the most portraits-per-sheet as any mod I use (for example, Sandy has 8 expressions instead of the base game 2, Krobus has 9, Magnus has 32 and Kent has 7.). Feel free to re-arrange my portraits to make them more compatible if need be, but please do not edit my artwork.",
